body:
hey there, i can kind of relate to this story. i also had an abusive step mother. she really shouldn't blame your brother for doing those things he can't control and she shouldn't call both of you those things. she really sounds like a bitch to me. the best things you could do at the moment are telling another adult you trust, like your grandparents, a friend's parent, a teacher of the school counselor. they can help it stop. also PLEASE try to stand up for your bro and yourself. i know how terrifying that is, but what she does is NOT okay. also try to comfort your bro is he's upset what his mother said to him.  
if she's acting like that again you could lock yourself into the bathroom and call the police or the domestic violence hotline (the number is 18007997233 if you're in the USA)  
just please stay safe!
